# Guitar Freaks 4th Mix (G*A24 VER. JAA): the first boot, from blank NVRAM, with the install
# cassette in the slot (MAME: -cassette install; HIRAKU: --cassette install). The CD first offers to
# update the CD-ROM drive's firmware (NOTE 604, "Press test switch"): Test starts the update and the
# install to the onboard flash. Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to
# compare with MAME.
game gtrfrk4m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 600 press "Service Mode" 8
from 0 every 60 snap
at 24000 quit
